@DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Health Check
GET {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Search Documents
GET {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Knowledge?query=dotnet&project=MyApp&tags=logging
Accept: application/json

### Get All Documents
GET {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Knowledge/documents
Accept: application/json

### Get Document by ID
GET {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Knowledge/{{documentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Reindex Documents
POST {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Knowledge/reindex
Accept: application/json

### Get All Profiles
GET {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Profiles
Accept: application/json

### Load Profile
POST {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Profiles
Content-Type: application/json

"./Profiles/developer-profile.md"

### OpenAI-Compatible Chat Completion (Non-Streaming)
POST {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "How do I use dependency injection in .NET?" }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "max_tokens": 2048,
  "project": "MyApp",
  "tags": ["dotnet"]
}

### OpenAI-Compatible Chat Completion (Streaming)
POST {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Explain async/await in C#" }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "max_tokens": 2048,
  "stream": true
}

### List Models
GET {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/models
Accept: application/json

### Get Model by ID
GET {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/models/auto
Accept: application/json

### Create Knowledge Document
POST {{DeveloperMemory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Knowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My New Document",
  "content": "# Document content here...",
  "project": "MyProject",
  "tags": ["dotnet", "api"]
}
